$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag Ground";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Halcyon II" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Dusk" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> face each other in heavily protected bases, vying for possesion of both the planet and the dropship that crashed between the two bases. The dropship is rumored to contain prototype turrets, advancedments to current technology that both <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> would love to have in their possesion. The two bases each have two power supplies, one for weapons and one for Inventories, elevators and command stations. Just because one set of generators is destroyed doesn't mean the enemy is incapacitated. Use teamwork to execute multiple objectives to win. There is a hidden base, look carefully!" @
         "\n\n<f1>Map By: <f0> Raoul Duke, Ideas and teleport script unwittingly provided by Optimizer(?) If I'm wrong let me know..."; 
         
